al others, we're waiting to see how their careers will turn out.","published":"2023-11-15T14:55:58.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/recruiting/story/_/id/38895893/how-top-50-2023-recruits-done-college-freshmen","type":"Story","byline":"Blake Baumgartner and Tom VanHaaren","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Raylen Wilson, No. 57 football recruit in ESPN Junior 300, commits to Michigan Wolverines","description":"Linebacker Raylen Wilson, the No. 57-ranked recruit in the ESPN Junior 300 out of Tallahassee (Florida) Lincoln, has committed to Michigan over Georgia.","published":"2024-01-23T15:55:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-sports/recruiting/football/story/_/id/32823300/raylen-wilson-no-57-football-recruit-espn-junior-300-commits-michigan-wolverines","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Tom VanHaaren","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Florida QB Aaron Philo exits in third quarter with injury at Florida State","description":"In the regular-season finale for both teams, Florida quarterback Aaron Philo was knocked out of the Gators' contest against the Florida State Seminoles in the third quarter after taking a hard hit following a run, and he was replaced by Tramell Jones Jr.","published":"2026-11-28T00:05:48.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50616023/injured-florida-quarterback-aaron-philo-exits-3rd-quarter","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Akron coach Joe Moorhead resigns after 5 seasons to pursue other opportunities","description":"Akron head coach Joe Moorhead is stepping down after five seasons with the Zips to pursue other opportunities, he announced Friday.","published":"2026-11-27T21:03:06.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50614041/akron-coach-joe-moorhead-resigns-pursue-other-opportunities","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who are the winningest college football coaches of all time?","description":"From Saban to Paterno, there are many legendary college football coaches. Who has the best career record? Check out who has the most wins now.","published":"2026-11-27T20:18:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/39283806/who-winningest-college-football-coaches-all","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Rivalry Week live: Top plays and playoff analysis","description":"It's the final week of the regular season. Here are the best plays, moments and CFP implications.","published":"2026-11-27T20:37:42.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50596213/rivalry-week-live-cfp-takeaways","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026 'College GameDay' Week 13: Duke vs. Wake Forest","description":"\"College GameDay\" heads to Wake Forest University for Week 13.","published":"2026-11-27T17:21:43.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50612493/2026-college-gameday-week-13-duke-vs-wake-forest","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"How every 2027 five-star college football prospect will fit","description":"There are 23 five-star players in the class, and we scout each one's game for the next level.","published":"2026-11-27T17:00:30.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/recruiting/story/_/id/48543549/college-football-recruiting-2027-prospects-five-star-scouts-take","type":"Story","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-27T15:51:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Houston, rivalry color rushes lead top uniforms of CFB Week 13","description":"Just because it's rivalry week doesn't mean teams still can't put their best foot forward with uniform swag.","published":"2026-11-27T15:00:13.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50598211/college-football-uniforms-week-13-houston","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4871074/raylen-wilson","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raylen_Wilson"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Raylen Wilson","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raylen_Wilson","description":"American football player (born 2005)","touched":"2026-11-22T23:50:20Z","intro":"Raylen Akin Wilson (born July 7, 2005) is an American college football linebacker for the Georgia Bulldogs of the Southeastern Conference (SEC).","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Wilson attended Lincoln High School in Tallahassee, Florida. As a senior, he had 117 tackles and as a senior and junior, he was the Tallahassee Democrat All-Big Bend Defensive Player of the Year. A five-star recruit, Wilson was selected to play in the 2023 Under Armour All-America Game. He originally committed to the University of Michigan to play college football but switched to the University of Georgia."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a true freshman at Georgia in 2023, Wilson played in 12 games with one start and had 15 tackles and 0.5 sacks. He returned to Georgia for his sophomore year in 2024."}],"family":[{"relation":"Father","name":"Robert Wilson","description":"American footballer, born 1974","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Wilson_(wide_receiver)"}]}}